          },
          "measuredAbsorbance": {
            "value": "目前，光源是 {{onOff}}，波长是 {{wavelength}} {{wavelengthUnits}}，比色皿中含有浓度为 {{concentration}} {{concentrationUnits}} 的 {{solutionName}} 溶液。测得的吸光度为 {{absorbance}}。"
          }
